WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.367
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:05.467
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:07.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:08.634
Well, guys, it seems like

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:09.934
there's so much
going on right now.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:12.067
Everyone's gearing up for
the midterms.

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:14.601
The World Series is heating up.

00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:18.234
The top-10 songs in the country
are all by Taylor Swift.

00:00:18.234 --> 00:00:20.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:25.434
Also, Stouffer's is releasing
its own Bloody Mary mix

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.033
that tastes like lasagna.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:28.334
There's a lot to go over.

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:30.000
Let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.801
It's time for "News Smash."

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:33.801
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:39.868
First up, the midterms.
They're less than a week away.

00:00:39.868 --> 00:00:41.667
Republicans are trying to win
back control of

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:42.934
the House and the Senate,

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:45.133
while the Democrats
want to hold on to both.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:47.467
Two sides going head-to-head,
kind of like...

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:48.834
the World Series.

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:51.834
Tonight was Game 4 between
the Phillies and the Astros.

00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:53.400
Both teams are doing
everything they can

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.300
to prove that they're the best
in the country.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.834
Speaking of the best
in the country...

00:00:56.834 --> 00:00:57.968
Taylor Swift.

00:00:57.968 --> 00:01:00.367
She's the first artist

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:04.033
to hold all top-10 spots
in the Billboard 100 at once.

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:05.400
That must feel good.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:08.033
And if you want to feel good,
too, maybe don't try...

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:11.400
Stouffer's new lasagna-flavored
Bloody Mary mix.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.534
It's vodka mixed with lasagna,

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:15.901
topped with a rim
of shredded mozzarella.

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:18.834
It's the perfect drink for
anyone who wants to black out

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:20.167
and forget all about...

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:21.167
the midterms.

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:23.534
It's a stressful time.

00:01:23.534 --> 00:01:25.667
President Biden has been
touring the country

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:27.400
trying to rally support
for Democrats,

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.734
but the only tour most people
care about is...

00:01:29.734 --> 00:01:30.834
Taylor's.

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:34.100
She announced her Eras Tour
this week.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.467
Tickets aren't available yet,

00:01:35.467 --> 00:01:37.000
but Swifties
are losing their minds,

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.200
foaming at the mouth,

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.234
which are also side effects
when you drink...

00:01:40.234 --> 00:01:43.300
Stouffer's lasagna-flavored
Bloody Mary mix.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:45.667
Look at this thing.
It's like a lasagna smoothie.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:47.334
It's like a V8 from hell.

00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:49.767
If you drink one of these,
you might get the...

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:50.801
runs.

00:01:50.801 --> 00:01:53.067
You need runs
if you want to win.

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:55.067
Philly's going to go nuts
if they win, by the way.

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:57.901
Police are already racing
to grease up light poles.

00:01:57.901 --> 00:01:59.767
Speaking of races and polls...

00:01:59.767 --> 00:02:00.968
the midterms.

00:02:00.968 --> 00:02:04.934
Dr. Oz is running for office
in Pennsylvania,

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:06.167
and you'll be
in a doctor's office

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:07.300
after drinking...

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:08.634
alcoholic lasagna.

00:02:08.634 --> 00:02:09.701
In conclusion...

00:02:09.701 --> 00:02:10.968
here we go...

00:02:10.968 --> 00:02:12.100
time to vote...

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:13.300
what a show...

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:14.434
just no.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:16.667
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:18.667
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:26.534
Well, speaking of the midterms
and the World Series,

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:28.467
yesterday, during a speech,
President Biden

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:30.267
said that Phillies fans

00:02:30.267 --> 00:02:33.000
are the most obnoxious fans
in the world.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.968
Yeah. Meanwhile, Jill was like,

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:39.067
"Uh, Joe, is there something
you want to tell me or..."

00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:42.834
And this was big.

00:02:42.834 --> 00:02:44.834
Tonight, Biden delivered
a prime-time speech

00:02:44.834 --> 00:02:47.033
from Capitol Hill
about the midterm elections

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.434
and said it could take
several days

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:51.834
for all of the votes to be
counted in some swing states.

00:02:51.834 --> 00:02:53.734
And, unfortunately,
after these past two years,

00:02:53.734 --> 00:02:56.567
every state is a swing state.

00:02:56.567 --> 00:02:57.834
Yeah, a lot of experts
are predicting

00:02:57.834 --> 00:02:59.634
a red wave on election day.

00:02:59.634 --> 00:03:00.934
And you can tell Biden
is nervous,

00:03:00.934 --> 00:03:02.567
because he already hired
Rudy Giuliani

00:03:02.567 --> 00:03:04.501
to challenge the results.

00:03:04.501 --> 00:03:06.767
Well, everyone's
talking about the midterms,

00:03:06.767 --> 00:03:08.934
and a lot of races
are coming down to the wire.

00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:11.434
Let me explain it all to you
with the "Midterms in Pictures."

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:12.467
Here we go.

00:03:12.467 --> 00:03:14.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.934
The midterm elections
are next Tuesday.

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:21.801
We're going to find out
if Congress is going

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:23.667
red, blue, or a...

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:25.801
different color altogether.

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:28.868
After months of campaigning,
voters are...

00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:30.634
tired and cranky.

00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:32.667
Watching commercial after
commercial has driven them

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:33.767
completely...

00:03:33.767 --> 00:03:35.100
insane.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.534
At this point, they'd be fine if
every candidate just...

00:03:37.534 --> 00:03:38.801
disappeared.

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:41.667
But the election is
important for our democracy,

00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:43.300
for our future, and for...

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:44.634
millions of kids.

00:03:44.634 --> 00:03:46.968
Now, of course,
not everyone can win.

00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:48.767
The losers will have to
take it on the...

00:03:48.767 --> 00:03:51.534
chin and get sent away on an...

00:03:51.534 --> 00:03:53.000
involuntary vacation.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.100
Meanwhile, the winners will
feel great until

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.567
their poll numbers start to...

00:03:56.567 --> 00:03:57.767
slide down.

00:03:57.767 --> 00:03:59.901
The important thing
is that everyone votes

00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:01.934
no matter what state
you live in,

00:04:01.934 --> 00:04:05.200
because voting is the best thing
about America since it was...

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.767
born in 1776.

00:04:06.767 --> 00:04:08.901
That was "Midterms in Pictures."

00:04:08.901 --> 00:04:10.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

