00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.300
Colon Fart.
-Alright, I think that's enough.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.200
Thank you very much.
I appreciate -- Thank you.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.033
Thank you. No, that's good.
Steve Higgins, everybody.

00:05:55.033 --> 00:05:58.133
That's more than -- Thank you.

